# Nightwalker narrative script
# schema 1
# line=<sequence>|<line-id>|<speaker>|<text-id>|<audio-id>|<duration-ms>|<subtitle text>
# The pipe character is reserved as a field separator in schema 1.
# Sequence-family rule: saint_denis.pre_fight and any saint_denis.pre_fight.* sequence
# form one non-repeating variation pool. Whole sequences are selected; individual lines are never shuffled.
schema=1

# Saint Denis confrontation family. Calm, old, metaphysical, predatory.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight|sd_soul_01a|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.01a|nw.audio.sd.soul.01a|1700|Do not ask what I am as though the world has only two answers.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight|sd_soul_01b|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.01b|nw.audio.sd.soul.01b|1700|I have stood where life ends and found no wall there.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight|sd_soul_01c|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.01c|nw.audio.sd.soul.01c|1500|Names are for things that stay on one side.

line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_02|sd_soul_02a|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.02a|nw.audio.sd.soul.02a|1700|Men pray for eternal life until eternity answers them.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_02|sd_soul_02b|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.02b|nw.audio.sd.soul.02b|1500|Then they call the answer cursed.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_02|sd_soul_02c|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.02c|nw.audio.sd.soul.02c|1600|I have had centuries to enjoy the joke.

line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_03|sd_soul_03a|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.03a|nw.audio.sd.soul.03a|1800|Death is not life's opposite. It is its oldest shadow.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_03|sd_soul_03b|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.03b|nw.audio.sd.soul.03b|1800|I have walked between them so long neither claims me.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_03|sd_soul_03c|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.03c|nw.audio.sd.soul.03c|1400|And still you step closer.

line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_04|sd_soul_04a|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.04a|nw.audio.sd.soul.04a|1500|The grave was once a terror to me.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_04|sd_soul_04b|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.04b|nw.audio.sd.soul.04b|2100|Then I learned it is only a door built by those afraid to look beyond it.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_04|sd_soul_04c|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.04c|nw.audio.sd.soul.04c|1600|I stopped knocking a very long time ago.

line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_05|sd_soul_05a|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.05a|nw.audio.sd.soul.05a|2100|You hear a heartbeat and call it life. You hear silence and call it death.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_05|sd_soul_05b|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.05b|nw.audio.sd.soul.05b|1800|Small words for a world that has never obeyed them.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_05|sd_soul_05c|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.05c|nw.audio.sd.soul.05c|1600|I learned that before this city had a name.

line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_06|sd_soul_06a|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.06a|nw.audio.sd.soul.06a|1900|Hunger is not beneath reason. Hunger is reason without manners.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_06|sd_soul_06b|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.06b|nw.audio.sd.soul.06b|1600|Men call theirs duty, love, ambition.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_06|sd_soul_06c|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.06c|nw.audio.sd.soul.06c|1600|I have only been more honest with mine.

line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_07|sd_soul_07a|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.07a|nw.audio.sd.soul.07a|1500|Every church promises another world.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_07|sd_soul_07b|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.07b|nw.audio.sd.soul.07b|1400|I merely returned from mine.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_07|sd_soul_07c|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.07c|nw.audio.sd.soul.07c|1600|You seem disappointed that it has teeth.

line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_08|sd_soul_08a|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.08a|nw.audio.sd.soul.08a|2200|I watched kings pile stone toward heaven because they feared the earth beneath them.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_08|sd_soul_08b|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.08b|nw.audio.sd.soul.08b|1700|Their crowns are dust. Their prayers are forgotten.
line=saint_denis.pre_fight.soul_08|sd_soul_08c|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.soul.08c|nw.audio.sd.soul.08c|1200|I remain.

# Defeat text. This remains valid even if no audio is supplied.
line=saint_denis.post_defeat|sd_post_01||nw.sd.post.01||3200|Inside the vampire's coat is a strip of paper bearing the same cut mark seen near the church.

# Future clue hooks; not automatically spawned in Phase 12.
line=saint_denis.clue.bloodless_body|sd_clue_body_01||nw.sd.clue.body.01||3000|The corpse is pale and nearly bloodless. The mud shows it was carried here.
line=saint_denis.clue.stone_mark|sd_clue_mark_01||nw.sd.clue.mark.01||3000|A narrow sigil has been cut beneath the old writing. The edges are fresh.

# Future alternate-outcome hooks. Phase 12 does not add a choice mechanic.
line=saint_denis.outcome.spared|sd_spared_01|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.outcome.spared.01|nw.audio.sd.spared.01|2600|Mercy is a debt, hunter. Pray I never come to collect.
line=saint_denis.outcome.withdrawn|sd_withdrawn_01||nw.sd.outcome.withdrawn.01||2600|The vampire recedes into the dark, leaving the bells to answer for him.
